+| 121041 | opacity | 2.393e-06 | 6.259e-08 | 8.950e-05 | 1.988e-06 | 0.02 |
+| 158600 | conic2D | 6.002e-03 | 3.172e-04 | 2.251e-05 | 1.293e-06 | 0.06 |
